# Mosswood Dreadknight: "you" is the player who controlled it as it died (CR 603.3a), and "your graveyard" is theirs. Bot1
# gives its Dreadknight to Bot2 with Harmless Offering and on turn 3 Bolts it: the dies trigger is Bot2's, and the card goes
# to Bot1's own graveyard (CR 400.3), which is not Bot2's, so nobody may cast it from there - Bot1, with {B} and {G}
# untapped, is not offered Dread Whispers from its graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mosswood Dreadknight
Black Lotus
Harmless Offering
Lightning Bolt
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x17

